                                            "processed": "\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003ECase Study\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EChallenge\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003EThe legacy Drupal 7 website was not the authoritative source for laboratory test information. Test data existed across multiple systems, creating inconsistencies for client services, sales representatives, and customers. The platform also relied on an aging architecture that limited future development.\u003C\/p\u003E\n"
