                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003EPhase 1 Solution\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EDrupal 7 -\u0026gt; Drupal 10\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e81c58c1b363e7b3b33be411a86e77058\u0022\u003EMigrated the website from Drupal 7 to Drupal 10.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e4eb874259afb154a0047d0f1c4e473f1\u0022\u003ECreated a single source of truth for laboratory test information.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e38e6505ef30828303e8c4293366e9aa5\u0022\u003EIntroduced a downloadable Test Menu PDF generated from the latest data.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e354499a76d399053a4d1649e09a22da0\u0022\u003EIntegrated Salesforce (Pardot) for marketing and lead capture.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022ed3e0a654c8c11a77d128b3379d7e1d61\u0022\u003EImproved confidence that internal teams and customers were accessing current test information.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003C\/ul\u003E\n"
