                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003EPhase 2 Solution\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EHeadless Platform\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e5766f3c786c525ebe31cb9a66ceb8674\u0022\u003ETransitioned to a headless architecture using Drupal 10, Next.js, and GraphQL.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e49452a14b552ec20d931159af03610e5\u0022\u003EHosted the application internally on Azure.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e7b0f6bbbecfd141f29bb6630cc1d2faa\u0022\u003EBuilt CI\/CD pipelines for Development, Test, and Production.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022ecae88c3718e2f94bb28fa3ed96fe8959\u0022\u003EDeveloped a custom Drupal module to synchronize test data from an internal source.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022ecb74657605c35fa507f36c5a86bdc341\u0022\u003EEnhanced search with Apache Solr for faster, more relevant results\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003C\/ul\u003E\n"
