                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003ESuccess\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EImpact\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003EThe project transformed a legacy website into a modern, scalable platform that serves as the trusted source for laboratory test information. By centralizing data, automating synchronization, and improving search, internal teams and customers can reliably access accurate, up-to-date information. The move to a headless architecture, combined with Azure hosting and automated CI\/CD pipelines, established a strong technical foundation that supports faster releases, easier maintenance, and future growth.\u003C\/p\u003E\n"
